Z||000010||Formula88||07-07-2001||02:19 PM||||SC3800 vs. Fist of the Northstar!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Yeah, now THAT's something I'd like to see.  Actually a shootout between some of Archie's V8's, Northstars, 3800SCs and some 3.4s or 3.4TDC thrown in for good measure.  Give everyone a good idea what can be expected from each setup.<P>Gee, if there's a dragstrip near Williamsburg VA, maybe this could go down at the Fiero convention in August?  Anyone interested?  Hell, I'll even run you guys in my stock Formula 5-speed just to give a baseline and see how bad you guys whup up on me.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
